---
name: tailwind-extract
description: Extract Tailwind classes from HTML into reusable components
---

Extract Tailwind classes from this HTML:

{{ input }}

Requirements:
1. Identify class patterns repeated 2+ times
2. Create @apply directives in /static/css/components.css
3. Keep responsive classes (sm:, md:, lg:)
4. Use semantic names (btn-primary, card-product, container-fluid)

Return:
1. CSS classes to add to components.css
2. Simplified HTML using new classes